		{
			dependencies: ["66FCC26399376B55"]
			description: [
				"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Take a peek at the \"},{\"color\":\"yellow\",\"underlined\":true,\"text\":\"Elements and Alloys quest book tab\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"25FEB9E61EEC1A96\"},\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"contents\":{\"text\":\"Click to go to the chapter\"}}},{\"text\":\". This might seem a bit premature to suggest, but it has a reason.\"}]"
				""
				"These are quests for a full stack of many of the materials in the game. Those are the materials you'll be able to use to synthesize &6Omnium&r, an important endgame resource. It's the pack's way of letting you know about materials you should be prepared to mass produce as you approach the end."
				""
				"Of course, it's not necessary or even advisable to try to finish up all of these quests the moment they become available. Some will be incredibly easy (like &6Iron&f and &6Copper&f), while others will be brutally grindy at early tech levels. The rewards are all the same: &91 Moniquarter each&f, so use your best judgement on which ones to complete and which to ignore for later."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			icon: "gtceu:omnium_ingot"
